{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For which real values of m are the simultaneous equations \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/5/37580e1c4d16328031e2535ca6214e51c5e3b758.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}y &amp;= mx + 3 \\\\  y&amp; = (2m - 1)x + 4\\end{align*}\" width=\"145\" height=\"42\" /> \n</p><p>satisfied by at least one pair of real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e53b1fe25be1c679117fb44a6a886fe1247d189a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"44\" height=\"20\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/e/e0ee42095f8836fa84cf681b8e69c158d258a661.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{all }m\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{all }m\\neq 0\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{all }m\\neq 1/2\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  \\text{all }m\\neq 1\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{no values of }m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"685\" height=\"18\" />  \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Setting the two expressions for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equal to each other yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/6/b160179642c4907cee6910b353d5e9ee74132f00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mx+3 = (2m-1)x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" />, which simplifies to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/a/bcab0d74f3dc93a3f69003b01419a27761fe97f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-1)x+1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"136\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/b/a5bcdfa6f2fbe48d23f19853abc301f3b7c5caad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\dfrac{1}{1-m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"88\" height=\"40\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a6ead4a21747d331e57da1c3541aa27890df1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }m\\neq 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-e_power_pi_times_i\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Any two lines with different slopes intersect.  So if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/3/723de21ed127f0a2aa527b60bab79c41a120dad1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\neq 2m - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"18\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/9/9f9e6aae9d8d0aa80ae018b3b231ef4a0baf8478.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"48\" height=\"17\" />, the lines intersect and thus the system has one solution.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/b/73baad1d05e4bc4d4067fd6dfcc164e339bf981a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />, however, the lines will have equations <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/4/a342046157d9a3a11dcc37c5c476edda01c5c607.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4f04931d26b00777e012b0821fdbfd42cb70f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = x + 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"77\" height=\"17\" />.  These lines have the same slope but different <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />-intercepts, so they are parallel and thus the system has no solutions.  \n</p><p>Therefore, the system has at least one solution if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a6ead4a21747d331e57da1c3541aa27890df1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) }m\\neq 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b>